# Coverage-directed scheduler regression fixture

```catala
declaration choose content integer
  depends on b content boolean
  equals if b then 1 else 0

declaration scope SchedulerTest:
  input first content boolean
  input second content boolean
  input outer content boolean
  output result content integer

scope SchedulerTest:
  definition result equals
    (choose of first) + (choose of second)
    + (if outer then 10 else 20)
```
